(label "LOGIC_GND" (at 78.74 792.48 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fab09f49-965f-56f6-8266-20dd81b6ccea"))
(text "T20F256 FPGA CORE / MINIMUM 8 MOTOR CHANNELS, 12-CHANNEL PIN CAPACITY CANDIDATE" (at 20.32 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2.4 2.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1cf9cf25-09a9-57b2-88d0-bfb96fb0cdb2"))
(text "Exact 256 balls: Efinix T20-PINOUT worksheet T20F256. Pin allocation is a board candidate, NOT vendor fit or routed timing.\nAll VCCIO=3.3V. All VCC/VCCA=1.2V. No 5V-tolerant FPGA connection. No native LVDS: REF_RES intentionally NC." (at 20.32 28 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "19386bf6-a5d8-56a5-9e98-030dd9d8dceb"))
(text "One 100nF per supply ball; bulk per physical supply group. Decoupling is a layout-study allowance, not a PDN proof.\nActive SPI x1 straps111; CSI/TEST high. Flash bus reserved from user RTL. CCK damping33R is provisional.\nCDONE is open-drain with10k pullup; status does not grant motion permission. Configuration clock is internal, not Y1." (at 560 28 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8cdf928e-dd85-50c9-9862-d920de75cc51"))
(text "RESET: U3 combines qualified upstream reset with service RUN for configuration reset only. U4/U5 make a separate CDONE-qualified user-logic reset; R25/C39 provide a bounded post-CDONE delay and service RUN can hold it low through a JTAG handoff. No programmer output fights the sequencer.\nUser-logic reset release threshold, RC tolerance, discharge time, tUSER handoff and startup/release synchronizers remain bench/HDL qualification gates.\nJ2 is a logical service boundary: actual keyed connector, adapter, cable loading and ESD are unresolved.\nJTAG programming requires a deliberate reset cycle, valid rails and machine outputs inhibited. No hot-plug or phantom powering." (at 20.32 740 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7531bcc2-a984-57f5-91c4-d0a418bf455d"))
(text "NC crosses are genuine unused GPIO/config outputs and REF_RES only; every supply/GND ball is connected.\nBoundary symbols are not released connectors. No footprint approval, PCB, DRC, bitstream, qualification or fabrication files." (at 165.1 785 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0cb64387-8487-57d6-90ec-a43a4c13b61b"))
(text "J1-J10 ARE INTERNAL LOGIC BOUNDARIES, NOT FIELD TERMINALS. Enables and extra home/alarm/encoder channels are reserves only.\nCRESET47k/1k plus two internal pullups screened. The separate 10k/1uF CDONE reset delay is a candidate, not a guaranteed time or safety function; threshold/partial-power confirmation required." (at 560 586 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0548f1bc-3565-557f-8dfb-c3f805c4716a")))
